{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "TOGUM",
    "steam_appid": 1105960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1105960/extras/77626e5b4d260cb4197b50c8058469f5.avif?t=1747661128\" /></div><br><br>                                                                                            <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">-- EPISODE 0: UNTIL DAWN --</h2><br><strong>TOGUM</strong> is a brazilian sci-fi indie game based on the events of the famous investigation called &quot;Opera\u00e7\u00e3o Prato&quot; ( Operation Saucer ).<br>Play as <strong>Priscilla Wu</strong>, a funny and extrovert young girl who lives in the neighborhood of the <strong>City of Vit\u00f3ria</strong> called Jerusalem with her mother <strong>Erika</strong>.<br>She was enjoying the holiday eve at her house, however, her friend <strong>Sayonara</strong> discovered a series of codes and hidden messages inside an abandoned house.<br>Do these codes have anything to do with the so talked about &quot;secret meeting&quot; that many believe takes place in her neighborhood?<br>And could this be related to the strange lights that have appeared in the middle of the sea?<br><br>* Made by just one person.<br><br>* It's my first PC game, so please be patient :)",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1105960/extras/77626e5b4d260cb4197b50c8058469f5.avif?t=1747661128\" /></div><br><br>                                                                                            <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">-- EPISODE 0: UNTIL DAWN --</h2><br><strong>TOGUM</strong> is a brazilian sci-fi indie game based on the events of the famous investigation called &quot;Opera\u00e7\u00e3o Prato&quot; ( Operation Saucer ).<br>Play as <strong>Priscilla Wu</strong>, a funny and extrovert young girl who lives in the neighborhood of the <strong>City of Vit\u00f3ria</strong> called Jerusalem with her mother <strong>Erika</strong>.<br>She was enjoying the holiday eve at her house, however, her friend <strong>Sayonara</strong> discovered a series of codes and hidden messages inside an abandoned house.<br>Do these codes have anything to do with the so talked about &quot;secret meeting&quot; that many believe takes place in her neighborhood?<br>And could this be related to the strange lights that have appeared in the middle of the sea?<br><br>* Made by just one person.<br><br>* It's my first PC game, so please be patient :)",
    "short_description": "Priscilla was enjoying the holiday eve at her house, however, her friend Nara discovers a series of codes and hidden messages inside an abandoned house. Could these codes be related to the strange lights that have appeared in the middle of the sea? Based on a true story...",
